    "final_answer": "I have found the information about the Hugging Face Pro account. Let me record the key findings:\n\n**Pro Account Price:** $9/month\n\n**Features:**\n1. 10× private storage capacity\n2. 2× public storage capacity\n3. 20× included inference credits\n4. 8× ZeroGPU quota and highest queue priority\n5. Host ZeroGPU, Gradio & Docker Spaces\n6. Spaces Dev Mode\n7. Personal blog publishing\n8. Dataset Viewer for private datasets\n9. Show your support with a PRO badge\n\nI have all the information needed to provide a clear answer.\n\n## Answer\n\n**Hugging Face Pro Account**\n\n**Price:** **$9 per month**\n\n**Features:**\n1. **10× private storage capacity** - Significantly more storage for private repositories\n2. **2× public storage capacity** - Doubled storage for public repositories\n3. **20× included inference credits** - Much higher inference usage allowance\n4. **8× ZeroGPU quota and highest queue priority** - Faster access to GPU resources\n5. **Host ZeroGPU, Gradio & Docker Spaces** - Ability to run various Space types\n6. **Spaces Dev Mode** - Development mode for Spaces\n7. **Personal blog publishing** - Publish your own blog on Hugging Face\n8. **Dataset Viewer for private datasets** - View and explore your private datasets\n9. **PRO badge** - Display a PRO badge on your profile to show your support\n\nThe Pro plan is described as a way to \"Boost your personal HF experience\" and is intended for individual users (separate from the Team plan at $20/user/month and Enterprise plan at $50/user/month).",
